  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">그동안 막연하게나마&nbsp; 교직 30년차가 되면 책을 내야겠다는 생각을 하며 살았습니다.&nbsp;그 바람이 32년차가 되는 올해 이루어져 '소중한 인연'이라는&nbsp;제목으로&nbsp;출간하였습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">저에게 너무나 소중한 분들과의 사연을 담아 책의 값을 매기지 않았습니다. 비매품이지만 ISBN등록을 하였고요. 재과만 선생님들이 아래의 목차를 보시고 희망하시면 우편으로 보내드리겠습니다.&nbsp;출간할 때 재과만 선생님들을 염두에 두고 권수를 정하였습니다. 그 범위 안에서 우송할게요. ^^</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">제 메일 주소는 <a href=\"mailto:kwpark0404@hanmail.net\">kwpark0404@hanmail.net</a> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">입니다. 일반 우편으로 보내도 배달사고 없이 받으실 수 있도록 학교 주소를 알려주시면 좋겠습니다.</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(199, 82, 82); font-size: 20pt; word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\"><font face=\"Gulim\">들어가는 글</font></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><br></font></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">선생님</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">우리도 실험해요</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선생님</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리도 실험해요            </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이스라엘은 교과서 없이 수업한다고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">순수한 열정을 맘껏 펼칠 수 있었던 학교</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">교훈적인 나라 싱가포르</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">무모한 도전의 시작</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개인 자격의 첫 학교 방문</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Raffles Secondary School/ Tampines Secondary School/ Serangoon Junior College)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">해변에서 만난 수녀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">아그네스           </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">짧은 영어 노 프라블럼</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(No problem) </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모범국민 싱가포르 사람들               </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제신사 데스만 선생님</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나는 전생에 싱가포르 사람이었을까</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육의 장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">場</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">으로 싱가포르를 선택한 사람들</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">매력 넘치는 말레이시아</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">역사의 도시 말라카에서 학교를 찾아가다</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 130%; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">먼 여정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">카</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">메론 하일랜드</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(Cameron Highlands) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt